as done  throughout the years if he chooses to  fight me of course welterweight below  muhammad spoke about his upcoming bout  with sean brady during the press  conference the two 170 pounders are  known for their grappling skills but  bella feels like he not only has the  advantage on the ground but is overall  the more skilled fighter i think i'm a  better grappler than him i think i'm a  better fighter than i think i'm better  everywhere so it's just whatever i  choose i feel like my last couple fights  i've been showing a different side every  single fight so this fight i'm just  gonna show another different side of me  after the ufc 280 press conference and  the ceremonial weigh-ins for ufc london  wrapped up two of the loudest most  entertaining and most promising stars in  the organization ran into each other on  the grounds sean o'malley sporting a  paddy the baddie wig greeted pimlet and  offered praise over the weight cut and  asked how long his saturday bout against  jordan levitt will last  year what the [ __ ] did you lose  before signing off for the day we're  going to leave you with some picks from  the pros for ufc london blades vs  aspinall give us your picks for tomorrow  in the comments patty the baddie vs  jordan levitt jack hermansen vs chris  curtis and finally the main event curtis  blades versus tom aspinall  uh i think tom assembly's gonna be the  next champion i got tom asking i wanted  to fight sean  curtis  oh  come on guys  sean what are you playing at  charles tom aspinall or curtis blades  i don't have a preference now i do  believe that they are both super  fighters and let's see what's going to  happen gotta love that fence  looking for more original mma content  check out the rest of thick boy youtube  exclusive interviews opinion and fight  analysis is available weekly on the shop  show food truck diaries and fight night  flashbacks subscribe so you don't miss  any of the action  you
 

